      "description": "Watch Bristol City vs Portsmouth highlights and goals from Championship on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 29, 2026. Tactical Duel at Ashton Gate Bristol City and Portsmouth faced off in a gripping Championship encounter that delivered high-stakes drama until the very last kick. On 2026-08-29 , the two sides contested a match defined by clinical finishing and a late resurgence that tested the nerves of the home supporters. Clinical Finishing Breaks the Deadlock The match began with both teams searching for an opening, but it was Bristol City who struck first in the 31st minute. Jed Wallace turned provider with a pinpoint pass to Lorent Tolaj , who calmly found the target to make it 1-0. The goal shifted the momentum in favor of the hosts, who managed to maintain their discipline and enter the half-time break with a hard-earned lead despite Portsmouth 's attempts to level the score. As the second half got underway, the intensity increased. In the 56th minute, following a brief period of pressure, Rio Cardines delivered a crucial assist for Jason Knight , who doubled the advantage for Bristol City . Now leading 2-0, the home side looked to control the game, though the match became increasingly physical. Yellow cards for Cardines , Knight , and Rob Dickie illustrated the defensive shift required to keep the visitors at bay. Late Penalty Sparks Dramatic Finish With the clock ticking towards full-time, Portsmouth threw everything forward, making several tactical substitutions including the introduction of Marko Milovanović . Their persistence paid off deep into stoppage time when they were awarded a penalty. In the 95th minute, Milovanović stepped up and converted from the spot, bringing the score to 2-1 and setting up a frantic final two minutes. Despite the late pressure, Bristol City held their nerve to secure the victory. The referee’s final whistle confirmed a 2-1 result, rewarding the hosts for their efficiency in front of goal while leaving Portsmouth to reflect on a spirited but ultimately unsuccessful comeback attempt in this exciting football match."
